nditions or some healthy older adults • Anti CCP An antibody against citrullinated proteins It is relatively specific for rheumatoid arthr\n<truncated 7224 bytes>\niled images of body tissues In simple words MRI is especially useful for muscles ligaments tendons cartilage bone marrow and spinal structures **Principle** • Hydrogen nuclei respond to a strong magnetic field • Radiofrequency pulses change their alignment temporarily • As they return they produce signals • A computer converts these signals into detailed images **Procedure** • Screen the patient for MRI safety including implants and metallic ob